  "description": "Welcome to the world of luxury, chaos, and leaky ceilings. You’ve just bought a rundown hotel with more problems than guests — but with a bit of grit (and a lot of disinfectant), you might just turn it into the hottest destination in town.\n\nSweep the floors, patch the walls, and hunt down that mysterious smell in room 103. Design every corner your way — from cozy single rooms to extravagant penthouse suites. Stock up your bar, hire competent (or at least conscious) staff, and keep those demanding guests happy.\n\nThe more satisfied your visitors, the better your reviews — and the closer you are to earning that five-star reputation. But remember: one clogged toilet can ruin everything.\n\nDream big, manage smarter, and maybe, just maybe, you’ll turn this disaster into a destination.\n\nBecause every great hotel starts with someone willing to clean up the mess.",
